            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nBefore you start, we recommend reading this previous text first:\n\n- **The Birth of a Star**: how a star is born inside a cloud of cold gas and dust (<htcite0>)",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "be57d0a5-4552-4b78-b817-6ac8d8fe11a5",
